WEBVTT

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:16.600
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:27.620
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:33.150
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:38.660
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:43.560
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:54.400
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:59.810
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:11.130
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:23.370
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:53.200
Keep your mouths
shut!

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:15.420
W... Who are
you?!

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.660
My name is Chie
Sagami-Ono.

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:28.740
I'll be escorting you to
the police station.

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.800
That should have happened
by now...

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:36.100
...but instead, all I get to do is practice
shooting at Headquarters.

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:39.370
How can I win a "Commendation
for Excellence..."

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:42.110
...so I can have my revenge
on that awful Yoriko?!

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:49.010
Damn!

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:53.660
Yoriko!

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:57.570
Well?

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.370
Missed every shot.

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:00.460
Not again.

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:05.000
You won't improve unless you keep
your eyes open when you shoot.

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:07.070
You're right.

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:10.170
But your type does best when it really counts.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:15.510
Like during the Police Academy exam,
I heard that you shot perfectly.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.780
Well, yeah!

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.750
And you were the only one!

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:19.910
You're right!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:22.820
No wonder you graduated at the top
of your class at the academy!

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:25.960
You're right! Just
a fluke, really.

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:29.720
Yoriko!

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:30.670
Chie!

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:32.900
Uh... Ms. Sagami-Ono!

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:38.400
Excuse me! You might officially be
at the top of our graduating class...

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:41.340
...but I'm the one who
was really the best!

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:42.480
Chie!

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:45.040
A little thing like that shouldn't be so upsetting.

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:47.770
"A little thing
like that?!"

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:55.320
FILE. 15
UP AGAINST CHIE
SAGAMl-ONO... AGAIN!

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:06.430
We're done for the day, Natsumi!

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:08.070
We're off patrol!

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:10.330
Got any plans for the rest of the day?

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:15.410
"Ooka Echizen:" Samurai TV series
I'm watching TV! Ooka Echizen's on
tonight. I'm not missing that!

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.070
I know, I know.
Oh, Yoriko!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.270
Miyuki! Natsumi!

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:25.780
So you have another fight
with Sagami-Ono?

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:30.350
She said that this time there'll
be no room for luck.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:34.450
It'll be a competition of shooting skills
and tactical command abilities.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:37.600
It'll be the four of us against her four.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:39.830
It'll be the four of us against her four.
In a survival game.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.530
Miyuki! Natsumi! Promise
me that you'll come!

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.760
Well, you can count me in.
I like that kind of thing.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.240
I'm passing.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:48.910
Why?!

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:51.900
I've got a date with my TV tonight.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:56.310
Natsumi! What's more important;
our friendship or TV?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.450
TV!

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:01.520
Come off it! You have to come!
You've got to help me!

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:04.520
Please please please, I'm
begging you to come!

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:06.660
"Loan Company"

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.040
Stop! Thief!

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:28.910
What a
haul!

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:31.480
"Aniki:" a big brother figure, similar to 'sempai'
You said it! Aniki,
you were brilliant!

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:36.180
But I still can't believe we got away
with it using just a model gun!

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:38.620
With all the armed robberies
these days...

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.750
...even fake guns will get them
to hand over the money!

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:45.760
That's ingenious, Aniki! You can't put
a price on college education, after all!

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:48.620
Guess not!

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.900
So where's our hideout? With
that college brain of yours...

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:54.440
...l'm sure you've got it all
worked out, don't you?!

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:57.240
Uh, leave it
up to me!

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:59.450
Take a right up there.

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:01.810
Take a right up there.
Right? That's a left, Aniki.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:04.820
I know! I know! I was
just testing you.

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:08.490
Make a right at the
next intersection.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.760
Hey, Aniki, where
are we?

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:20.530
Where? Well, we're,
uh, we're...

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.000
I got it!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.100
What? You do?

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:23.840
What?

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.670
Nothing. Go ahead, what do you think?

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:30.500
We'll hide behind this wall until the
police call off the search, right?

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:35.050
That's right! You're catching on quickly, kid!

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:36.680
That's because you're a good teacher, Aniki!

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:40.790
Hanging around with a college grad like
me is a good influence on you, huh?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:44.980
That's for
sure.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.770
"Sagami-Ono"

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:09.520
I'd heard she was rich, but an estate this
size in the middle of Tokyo is absurd!

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.650
No kidding.

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:22.250
Yoriko, welcome to my backyard.
And now, let the games begin.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:30.130
Here are the paintguns. Choose
whichever ones you want.

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:33.770
Wow. These are
really beautiful.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:38.940
Aren't they, though? They're exact
replicas, right down to the weight.

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.770
The bullets are,
of course...

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.240
Each paintball weighs
0.2 grams...

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:48.880
...has a velocity of 100
meters per second...

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:51.290
...and, if I'm not mistaken, has
under one joule of power.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:53.150
H... Ho... How?

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:56.130
But they're too nice
to use in a game.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:08:01.740
Ha! My team will skillfully demonstrate
their capabilities on you!

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.730
Judy, of the U.S.
Marines.

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:07.730
Cindy, of the French
Army.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:10.740
And Reika Ryu of
China's Army.

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:14.240
Huh? What's
with them?

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:17.750
I've asked them
to come.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.450
Despite my superior
tactical skills...

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:23.990
...there's no point in having a team
that can't keep up with me.

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:27.360
That may be, but it's hardly fair for
you to go and hire professionals!

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:32.360
My, my! But you must admit that team sel-
ection is important to strategic planning.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:35.660
Looks like Yoriko here doesn't
have too many connections.

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:37.700
And yet she challenges
me to a fight.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.860
<i>I'm not the one who suggested</i>
<i>this thing!</i>

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:44.110
This is the best team you
could round up, is it?

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:47.040
Why you! What do
you mean by that?!

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.120
Let it go, Natsumi!

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:50.520
Let it go, Natsumi!
Bitch!

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:53.450
Or perhaps you realized that
you could never beat me...

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.820
...and are prepared to give in right
from the start, huh, Yoriko?

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:57.580
In any case, you're just going
to have to go through with it.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.850
Yes, Chie, I understand.

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:03.290
This time we have
special rules.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:07.200
As soon as either Yoriko or myself
is hit, the contest is over.

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.270
However, the penalty for anyone
else who gets hit...

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:12.340
...is that they have
to play dead...

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:15.170
...and not move until
the game is over.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.840
Any objections?

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.330
Any objections?
Huh? Fine with me!

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:21.350
All right. We'll start the
game in five minutes.

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:27.850
Listen up. As long as Yoriko's
the last one left, we win.

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:31.110
So, Yoriko, that means you'll go with
Aoi and find a place to hide.

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:36.360
Yeah. I'll make Chie regret the day she came
up with this idea, Yoriko. Don't worry!

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:43.000
But no violence, okay? Promise
me. No violence!

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:44.870
I know that!

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:46.110
You're sure?

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:47.470
Yeah, I'm sure!

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:48.980
Cross your heart and hope to die?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.740
Cross my heart and hope to die!

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:53.470
What you're saying is I'm only allowed
to break one bone in her body.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.480
<i>She still doesn't get it.</i>

00:09:56.920 --> 00:10:01.120
Whatever. Anyway, Natsumi and
I will circle around from the left.

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:04.550
Aoi, you two go right and
find a good hiding place.

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:07.360
All you have to
do is stay put.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.690
Don't think about
taking a shot.

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:10.730
Okay.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:11.570
All right, it's time.

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:13.060
Take good care of Yoriko!

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.330
I will!

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:22.140
Cindy! Judy! You two come
around on the right.

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:24.700
Reika and I will circle
in from the left.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.850
Okay.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:44.060
What should we do? From there they've
got a complete advantage over us.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.700
Leave it
to me.

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:49.290
We'll use this! If they
are amateurs...

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:54.340
...they won't react to this when they
see it. But if they're pros...

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:02.540
What?!

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:06.410
Got her!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.250
Gotcha!

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:18.730
Hey, Aniki. You hear
all that noise?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.330
What's that?

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:36.150
The old Ninja dummy trick! Never fails!

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.520
Oh my God!

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.610
Don't take this personally, sweetheart.

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:44.580
That's one down
for me!

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:48.460
Stay still until we
come get you.

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.790
She snuffed
her!

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:01.500
Aniki, did you see that?!
She just killed her!

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.510
Who's there?!

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:11.990
Damn. They
got away.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:22.000
Aniki, can you believe what we just saw?!

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.330
I know.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:24.900
That chick is dead!

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:28.240
I know! Shut up! She's got to be a pro.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:29.240
A pro?!

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:31.760
She was too calm about the whole thing.

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:37.700
If she was gonna kill that blonde
out of hatred...

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:41.640
Then she would have had something
to say to her before she killed her.

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:43.280
But instead...

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.420
<i>"Don't take this personally, sweetheart."</i>

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:58.260
It almost seemed like the end
of a little game to her!

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:01.070
Like the end of a game!

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:02.470
Uh... yeah...

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:06.160
And did you see how she stood
over her victim like that?!

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:07.670
Yeah.

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:09.940
She was checking her pulse.

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:12.380
She was checking to make
sure she was dead!

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:14.280
Not something an amateur
would do!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.250
Aniki, let's get out of here! Let's
get out right now, while we can!

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:24.120
Are you nuts? If we leave now, the
cops will be onto us in a second!

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:27.390
Then we can kiss this
money good-bye.

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.050
We have to stick it out.
Just stick it out.

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:30.930
But what if we get killed?!

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:32.400
But what if we get killed?!
Shh!

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:39.140
That's weird. I could've sworn
I heard somebody over here.

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:54.290
Dah!

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.010
What in the hell do you think
you're doing, you moron?!

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.660
There they
are!

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:04.630
Stop!

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:11.330
Miyuki!

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:13.370
Natsumi! They're
over there!

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:14.940
Reika!

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:17.070
Reika!
Got them!

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.790
Listen. You stay here
and pin them down.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:34.290
I'll go and hunt
down Yoriko.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:42.160
Damn! They're gonna
pin us down...

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.790
...until they can
find Yoriko!

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:45.300
I'm gonna bust
outta here!

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:48.700
You can't! She is
a pro, after all!

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:50.940
We only got the others because
we caught them by surprise.

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:55.050
Well, we can't just sit here
like trapped rats forever!

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:57.380
I'm sticking to my plan and
ramming my way out!

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:00.040
Wait!

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:04.420
HeyHeyHeyHey!

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.920
What's going on? I don't
believe my eyes!

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:27.640
Aniki, did you hear that?
What was it?

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:31.550
I don't know. But it wasn't
something of this world.

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:34.690
Tell me we're still
in Japan.

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:39.050
Answer me! Say some-
thing, Aniki!

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:41.790
You've heard about
parallel worlds?

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:44.060
What? Parasol?

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:46.200
No, you fool! I said
parallel world.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:50.160
It's another world somewhere in the uni-
verse that appears identical to our own.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:52.670
But there are slight
differences.

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:54.970
Yeah...

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:57.510
We climbed that
wall, right?

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:58.440
Yeah.

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:02.170
When we did, we might have crossed
over into a parallel world.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:03.380
And?

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:06.580
So it appears to be Japan,
and yet it's warped.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:09.420
People here are shooting off
guns, just like in America.

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:12.690
"A Japan that's
like America."

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:16.260
If only we hadn't robbed
that loan company!

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:18.990
It was your idea to
do that, Aniki!

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:22.140
Yeah, but it's your fault that
we climbed over the wall!

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:25.000
You said that was
your plan, Aniki!

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:28.140
Quit passing
the blame!

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:31.680
All right, all right!
Calm down!

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:36.710
That scream we heard sounded
kind of like Natsumi.

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.680
I wonder if she's
okay?

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.720
What a doll
she is!

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:45.860
What's that?

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:52.660
It's all over. All right, throw down
your gun and put your hands up.

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:58.500
Where's Yoriko? Be a pal
and tell me, would you?

00:16:58.670 --> 00:16:59.600
I don't know.

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:02.670
Looking after your
friend, huh?

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:05.370
Oh no! Don't hurt my
pretty little girl.

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:07.510
Aniki, what are you
talking about?

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:10.210
Yoriko! Yoriko! Can
you hear me?

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:12.410
Yoriko? Who's
she?

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:13.850
How should
I know?!

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:17.980
I've captured your friend
Aoi, so come on out!

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:20.620
We'll fight it out between
us. Just you and me.

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:24.560
She's an evil one! Taking
a hostage like that!

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:28.160
Yoriko! Don't
come out!

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:31.570
It doesn't matter what
happens to me!

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:35.970
Yoriko! If you don't come out, I'll just have
to blow away your sweet little friend here.

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:39.080
And believe me, getting hit
can be pretty painful.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:42.840
Pretty painful, my foot! Getting
hit will kill you!

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:46.040
I bet she's killed
lots of people.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.590
Yoriko! Don't even
listen to her!

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:54.720
I get it. She's behind
that tree, isn't she?

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:56.450
Why do you
say that?

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.620
I could tell where you
were looking.

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:03.170
I won't be needing you
anymore. Good-bye.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:12.680
Here I come,
Yoriko.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.850
What a waste! She
was so beautiful!

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:18.180
This is terrible!

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:22.180
Come on out, Yoriko! I know
you're hiding in there!

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:31.120
Looks like you've
lost this time.

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:36.160
This isn't for
real! Damn!

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:41.910
Where'd she go?

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:44.950
Surrender.

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:46.910
Surrender.
Or else.

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:51.010
Chie, let's just put
an end to this!

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:57.280
No way! Not until I've made you realize
how superior my skills are to yours!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:01.150
But first, I'm going to be generous,
and give you one last chance!

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:05.290
Yoriko! Aim your
gun at me!

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:08.030
Come on!

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:14.040
Listen, Kaz. Now's
our chance.

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:24.050
We've got to get away while
we still can, Bro!

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:27.480
What's the matter, Yoriko? Aren't
you going to shoot?

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:31.550
I don't believe you. Blowing your
last chance for survival.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:38.060
Hey, wait!

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:43.400
Don't shoot me. Why don't you just
drop your gun and stop this?

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:48.300
No good comes from killing. Put down
your gun forever, and let this girl live.

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:51.840
Huh? Who
are you?

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:53.380
Aniki!

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:57.680
It's up to you. You can make amends
for the one you killed.

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:03.350
The girl with the glasses is the
other girl's friend, isn't she?

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:07.420
Come on. Just
let her go.

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:16.530
Aniki!

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:23.330
Sabu, I'm so sorry I
got you involved...

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:26.540
Aniki...

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:33.840
Huh... who on earth are
these guys, anyway?

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:37.590
Yoriko!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.320
You got me!

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:44.130
Yoriko!

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.870
You okay?

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:47.830
Sorry guys, I lost!

00:20:50.070 --> 00:20:52.400
That's right, and I won,
fair and square!

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:55.440
That's all fine and good,
but who are these two?

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:57.200
They've passed
out.

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:01.750
They must be from the neighborhood.
And the person who shot them was...

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:03.210
Who? Me?

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:06.550
You got it. So you can
take care of them.

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.710
See ya. Oh yeah,
Yoriko...

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:15.450
...now I've put you in your place, don't
go around acting so important!

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:19.960
What'd she say that for?
I never do that!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.200
"Traffic Safety..."

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:25.470
What's this?!
"Traffic Safety..."

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:26.130
What's this?!

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:32.870
"Off-duty Policewoman Nabs Loan Com-
pany Thieves, Gets Commendation"

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:37.620
Those two guys Yoriko
shot were criminals!

00:21:37.720 --> 00:21:42.480
Yoriko! You keep
lucking out!

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:10.950
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:19.560
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me Ionely.</i>

00:22:22.260 --> 00:22:30.570
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:38.670
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:40.150 --> 00:22:47.410
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:48.960 --> 00:22:56.330
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:56.660 --> 00:23:03.890
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:13.610
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:16.710
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:22.890 --> 00:23:24.820
"Bold and Brash"

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:30.460
Hey, guys! I heard Nakajima is speeding
around on a black Ducati!

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:31.200
Huh?!

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:33.760
Huh?!
That's exactly Nakajima's style.

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:37.330
This can't be happening, but judging
from the way he rides...

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:39.200
So where is the
real Nakajima?

00:23:39.370 --> 00:23:42.340
It's getting more suspicious
because we can't find him!

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:45.910
Next time on You're Under Arrest,
File 16, "Nakajima's Double?"

00:23:45.910 --> 00:23:47.250
FILE. 16
NAKAJIMA'S
DOUBLE?
Next time on You're Under Arrest,

00:23:47.250 --> 00:23:50.250
Nakajima, are you going to stop
driving for the police?
